

--[[
    Remote Path Finder (with Copy All)
    - Scans the entire game for all RemoteEvents and RemoteFunctions.
    - Displays the full, copyable path for each remote found.
    - Added a "Copy All" button to copy the entire list to your clipboard.
]]

